# Destinations whose reachability attempts are recorded in the watch
# table with the executable and cgroup that made them, in addition to
# the ordinary net records. One IPv4 or IPv6 address or CIDR per line.
# Nothing here is enforced.
#
# Cloud instance metadata services, a credential-theft target.
169.254.169.254
fd00:ec2::254
#
# Public DNS-over-HTTPS resolvers bypass the host resolver and hide
# names from the dns table. Enable them where the host resolver is the
# only legitimate resolver; plain DNS to these addresses would be
# recorded as well.
# 1.1.1.1
# 1.0.0.1
# 8.8.8.8
# 8.8.4.4
# 9.9.9.9
# 2606:4700:4700::1111
# 2606:4700:4700::1001
# 2001:4860:4860::8888
# 2001:4860:4860::8844
# 2620:fe::fe
